  "option_template_description":"Samurai Time is a 2D action game set in rooms, developed for the GameName Jam. You control a samurai trapped in a cursed temple, battling spirits while searching for a way out. Use quick attacks with your sheathed sword to defend yourself, and by unsheathing it, freeze time to execute precise and strategic strikes. Dynamic combat with two attack styles. Time-stopping mechanic as a special ability. Exploration of interconnected rooms within a mysterious temple. Simple enemies with predictable patterns. The game is still in development, and some mechanics may be subject to adjustments. Developed during the GameName Jam.",
